Substitute \(a = 2.5\) and \(b = -2.5\) back into \(2 = a + b + c\):
\[ 2 = 2.5 - 2.5 + c \]
\[ c = 2 \]

So the polynomial is:
\[ a_n = 2.5n^2 - 2.5n + 2 \]

